# dexforge-{{oem}}

{{oem_title}} arm drivers for [`dexhal`](../../dexhal/README.md).

The crate in `rust/` links against `dexhal` and owns only the arm-specific
generated kinematics, analytical IK, dynamics and hardware I/O. It was
scaffolded with `codegen/scaffold.py`; see `codegen/README.md` for the
generation workflow.

```sh
cargo test --manifest-path repos/dexforge-{{oem}}/Cargo.toml
```
